<div class="bb-quote"><b>Powerhound_2000 wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">There is no way that I know of to specifically search for a one-shot and put into hand for any hero deck nor a way for another hero to grant you that ability. &nbsp;You do have to depend on card draw to get those and once you do it would be potent. &nbsp; In the setup with Scholar and Nightmist I&#39;d say make sure you have Scholar in turn order after Nightmist otherwise playing a Mistbound from the top of her deck would expire before affecting the villain.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
